sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as AI agent
  participant AD as Adapter<br/>(MCP / OpenAI / Guard API)
  participant G as Gateway pipeline
  participant P as Policy engine
  participant T as Taint tracker
  participant U as Upstream tool
  participant D as Injection detector
  participant L as Audit log
  A->>AD: call tool(read_email, {email_id})
  AD->>G: ToolCall
  G->>P: evaluate_call(call)
  P-->>G: reasons, profile, sink
  G->>T: evaluate_call(call, profile, sink)
  T-->>G: taint reasons
  G->>G: combine (deny-overrides) + approval check
  G->>L: append tool_call.decision (HMAC chain)
  alt ALLOW
    G->>U: execute
    U-->>G: ToolResult (untrusted email text)
    G->>D: scan(content)
    D-->>G: score, spans, language
    G->>G: sanitise / spotlight per policy
    G->>T: register_result (labels + values)
    G->>L: append tool_result.inspection
    G-->>AD: inspected content
  else DENY
    G-->>AD: blocked + bilingual reason
  end
  AD-->>A: tool result
